					34, 39, § 212</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A winding</i>, <i>circuit</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui (Tanais) per sinuosos labitur circumflexus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 22, 8, 27</span></i>
			.</div>
